---
/* src/components/PhilosophyText.astro */
---
<section class="py-20 px-6 border-t border-border bg-background/50">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-4">Our Philosophy</p>
    <blockquote class="font-mono text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-foreground leading-relaxed italic mb-8">
      "In computer science, a bitmap is a data structure that represents a spatially mapped array of bits."
    </blockquote>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto font-mono text-sm">
      We translate this concept to sound — mapping digital information to human emotion through carefully architected sonic experiences.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>